OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer who sent girl, 14, 
OL,4,Asexual texts jailed                    
OL,6,FA former police officer who sent sexual
OL,7,Fmessages to a "vulnerable" girl he met 
OL,8,Fwhile on duty has been jailed.         
OL,10,FLeicester Crown Court heard that       
OL,11,FMatthew Hunt, 27, started messaging the
OL,12,Fgirl, who was 14 at the time, after    
OL,13,Fresponding to a missing person report. 
OL,15,FThe court heard that after initially   
OL,16,Fbeing friendly, the messages turned    
OL,17,Fsexual, with the former                
OL,18,FNorthamptonshire Police officer        
OL,19,Fbringing up masturbation and           
OL,20,Fpornography.                           
