OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer who sent girl, 14, 
OL,4,Asexual texts jailed                    
OL,6,FHunt, from Earl Shilton near Hinckley, 
OL,7,Fwas sentenced to 14 months in prison,  
OL,8,Fhaving previously pleaded guilty to    
OL,9,Fsexual communication with a child and  
OL,10,Fmisconduct in a public office.         
